Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.65,0:22:27.58,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Everything melts into the dead of the night
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.65,0:22:27.58,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}万物消融于夜的死寂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.58,0:22:32.96,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.58,0:22:32.96,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}仿佛连引力也渐渐消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.63,0:22:39.13,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.63,0:22:39.13,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}那火花般闪耀的笑容令我如此着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.59,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}寂しい　忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.59,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}多么寂寞  终将被忘却的夜晚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:52.06,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.97,0:22:52.06,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}再让我听听那无聊却又惹人怜爱的话语吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:58.73,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Dance with me　二人で無限の闇は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.77,0:22:58.73,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}与我共舞  我们在这无边的黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:01.57,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}重ねた手のひら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.73,0:23:01.57,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}重叠交织的手掌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:04.57,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}きゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.11,0:23:04.57,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}紧扣在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.57,0:23:10.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.57,0:23:10.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}模糊的视野中映出的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:16.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}悲しいくらいに美しいんだね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.79,0:23:16.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}美得令人心生悲怜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.88,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.88,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}远方的天边黎明将至
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.71,0:23:25.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.71,0:23:25.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}我的视线也渐渐飘散
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:38.48,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Stay in night
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.68,0:23:38.48,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}只愿留在此夜
